	(text "Q1 gate: 10k series and 47 nF to the drain limit the ramp to about 20 V/ms; 470 nF to the source holds Vgs under 1.1 V on a hot plug (10 x Cgd); the Zener caps Vgs at 15 V for input transients up to the 26 V TVS clamp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "022dcd94-abb0-5eaa-aba3-054d4863a481")
	)
	(text "STATUS LED: red = standby (about 0.8 mA from VIN, off when +3V3 is up), green = on (+5V, about 1 mA), both = +3V3 missing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae7fdac4-3f91-5a59-b288-229860c68be7")
	)
	(text "LTC2954 DECOUPLING CAPACITORS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c08f6a10-eaed-5f82-a767-1e21ae63815b")
	)
	(text "LTC2954-2: tap PB = on, hold = off. EN# drives the P-FET gate; KILL# from GPIO10 (active low, 100 ms pulse). INT# tells GPIO1 to shut down cleanly; holding PB cuts power about 6.4 s later (1 uF on PDT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cd6a1106-afdb-5a58-918b-462b2961768f")
	)
